<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>IBPS RRB Officer & Assistant 2027 Pro Portal - SHIV</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,600&family=Segoe+UI:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9c3 0%, #fef08a 35%, #fce7f3 70%, #fbcfe8 100%);
      --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
      --card-border: #db2777;
      --accent-yellow: #b45309;
      --accent-pink: #db2777;
      --text-main: #090d16;
      --text-muted: #334155;
      --header-tcs: #143e5c;
      --box-bg: #ffffff;
      --c-not-visited: #e2e8f0;
      --c-not-answered: #c2410c;
      --c-answered: #15803d;
      --c-review: #6d28d9;
      --glow-pink: 0 0 25px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.45), 0 0 50px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
    }

    body.dark-mode {
      --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #090d16 0%, #171331 50%, #0f172a 100%);
      --card-bg: rgba(23, 27, 44, 0.98);
      --card-border: #f472b6;
      --text-main: #ffffff;
      --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
      --header-tcs: #090d16;
      --box-bg: #161b2e;
      --c-not-visited: #334155;
      --glow-pink: 0 0 25px rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.55), 0 0 50px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.35);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; user-select: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-gradient);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .view-screen { display: none; width: 100%; min-height: 100vh; }
    .active-view { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

    /* DASHBOARD THEME TOGGLE */
    .dashboard-theme-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      background: rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.15);
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-pink);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 7px 16px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.3);
      transition: 0.25s;
    }
    .dashboard-theme-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-pink); color: #fff; transform: scale(1.04); }

    /* STAGE 1: Hero & Dashboard */
    .hero-container {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 34px 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .corner-mascot-left {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 12px;
      left: 14px;
      width: 110px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.35));
      animation: floatA 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .corner-mascot-right {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 12px;
      right: 14px;
      width: 105px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4));
      animation: floatB 3.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.4s;
    }
    .anime-mascot-mid-left {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20%;
      left: 20px;
      width: 110px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 8;
      animation: floatB 4s ease-in-out infinite;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.45));
    }
    .anime-mascot-mid-right {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20%;
      right: 20px;
      width: 115px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 8;
      animation: floatA 4s ease-in-out infinite 0.6s;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.5));
    }

    @keyframes floatA {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-9px); }
    }
    @keyframes floatB {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-11px); }
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-pink);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 36px;
      max-width: 920px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 5;
    }
    .profile-wrap { text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .profile-img-circle {
      width: 170px;
      height: 170px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 4.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      object-fit: cover;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.5);
      background: #fef08a;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .candidate-name-badge {
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #9d174d;
      margin-top: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    body.dark-mode .candidate-name-badge { color: #f472b6; }
    .quote-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .quote-english {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 21px;
      color: #701a75;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    body.dark-mode .quote-english { color: #fbcfe8; }
    .quote-hindi {
      font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
      font-size: 26px;
      color: #92400e;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    body.dark-mode .quote-hindi { color: #fef08a; }
    .hawking-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1.5px dashed rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.4);
    }
    .hawking-img {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2.5px solid #d97706;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .action-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #db2777);
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.4);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }
    .action-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.55); }
    .btn-back {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 2px solid #94a3b8;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    /* 16:9 Landscape Banner Wrapper */
    .yt-thumbnail-wrap {
      max-width: 720px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto 18px auto;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2.5px dashed var(--accent-pink);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: var(--glow-pink);
    }
    .yt-aspect-container {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fef08a;
    }
    .landscape-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

    /* Extra Quick Vault Action Strip next to Tables/Banner */
    .vault-side-strip {
      max-width: 720px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .btn-vault-chip {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      color: #9d174d;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-pink);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.25);
      transition: 0.2s;
      text-align: center;
    }
    body.dark-mode .btn-vault-chip { color: #f472b6; }
    .btn-vault-chip:hover {
      background: var(--accent-pink);
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* MATH VAULT WITH GLOWING LINES */
    .math-vault-screen {
      padding: 24px 18px;
      background: var(--bg-gradient);
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .math-header-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2.5px solid rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.35);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .tables-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .table-box {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid #eab308;
      border-top: 6px solid #db2777;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.9;
      font-family: monospace;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.35), 0 0 8px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.25);
    }
    .table-box h3 { color: #be185d; font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
    body.dark-mode .table-box h3 { color: #f472b6; }

    .cubes-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .cube-box {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid #f472b6;
      border-top: 6px solid #9333ea;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: monospace;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.35);
    }
    .cube-box b { color: #7e22ce; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 800; }
    body.dark-mode .cube-box b { color: #c084fc; }
    .cube-box span { color: #b45309; font-weight: 800; font-size: 25px; display: block; margin-top: 6px; }
    body.dark-mode .cube-box span { color: #fde047; }

    .squares-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(125px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .square-box {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 1.5px solid #ca8a04;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(202, 138, 4, 0.3);
    }
    .square-box b { color: #15803d; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; }
    body.dark-mode .square-box b { color: #4ade80; }

    /* Divisibility Rules & Generic Cards */
    .rules-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .rule-card {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid #0284c7;
      border-left: 7px solid #0284c7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
    }
    .rule-num { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0369a1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    body.dark-mode .rule-num { color: #38bdf8; }
    .rule-desc { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; }
    .rule-eg { font-size: 13.5px; color: #7c2d12; margin-top: 5px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; }
    body.dark-mode .rule-eg { color: #fde047; }

    /* Percentage-to-Fraction Grid */
    .frac-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .frac-card {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid #ca8a04;
      border-top: 5px solid #d97706;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
    }
    .frac-card b { font-size: 20px; color: #b45309; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    body.dark-mode .frac-card b { color: #fde047; }
    .frac-card span { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: #059669; }
    body.dark-mode .frac-card span { color: #34d399; }

    /* Syllabus & Reasoning Cards */
    .syll-card {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid #ec4899;
      border-left: 6px solid #be185d;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.25);
    }
    .syll-card h3 { color: #be185d; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    body.dark-mode .syll-card h3 { color: #f472b6; }
    .syll-list { list-style: disc inside; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }

    /* STAGE 5: Setup & Prompt Access */
    .setup-wrap {
      max-width: 860px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-pink);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .timer-selector-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      background: rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.12);
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.4);
    }
    .time-chip {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      color: #9d174d;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-pink);
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .time-chip.active { background: #db2777; color: #ffffff; }
    .time-custom-input {
      width: 75px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-pink);
      color: #9d174d;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .prompt-banner-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .btn-prompt-open {
      background: #7c3aed;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.4);
    }
    .setup-wrap textarea {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      background: rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.2);
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 2px solid #ca8a04;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      outline: none;
    }

    /* AI PROMPT MODAL */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .modal-card {
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      border-radius: 18px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 740px;
      max-height: 85vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .modal-header {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .modal-body {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      flex: 1;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .modal-footer {
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-top: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    /* REAL TCS EXAM SCREEN */
    .top-exam-nav {
      background: var(--header-tcs);
      color: #fff;
      min-height: 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .auto-toggle { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #fff; }
    .switch { position: relative; width: 34px; height: 18px; }
    .switch input { opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0; }
    .slider {
      position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background-color: #64748b; border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .slider:before {
      position: absolute; content: ""; height: 12px; width: 12px; left: 3px; bottom: 3px;
      background-color: white; border-radius: 50%; transition: .2s;
    }
    input:checked + .slider { background-color: #22c55e; }
    input:checked + .slider:before { transform: translateX(16px); }

    .btn-mobile-palette-toggle {
      display: none;
      background: #d97706;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: none;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .exam-split {
      display: flex;
      flex: 1;
      height: calc(100vh - 52px);
      background: var(--box-bg);
      position: relative;
    }
    .q-main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      border-right: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .q-strip {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    }
    .q-body {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .prompt-text {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      white-space: pre-line;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .opt-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 11px;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .opt-row input { margin-right: 14px; transform: scale(1.25); }
    .opt-row.review-correct { background: #dcfce7 !important; border-color: #22c55e !important; color: #14532d !important; font-weight: 800; }
    .opt-row.review-wrong { background: #fee2e2 !important; border-color: #ef4444 !important; color: #7f1d1d !important; font-weight: 800; }

    .inline-explanation-box {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.1);
      border-left: 5px solid #db2777;
      border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: none;
    }

    .q-footer {
      min-height: 56px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
      border-top: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-act {
      border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd;
      background: #bfdbfe;
      color: #1e3a8a;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .btn-save {
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #1d4ed8;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .btn-submit {
      background: #16a34a;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    /* Right Palette Dock */
    .palette-dock {
      width: 320px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    }
    .user-tag {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
    }
    .palette-avatar-circle {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      object-fit: cover;
      background: #fef08a;
      display: block;
    }
    .legend-table {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
    }
    .shape-ans {
      width: 24px; height: 22px; background: var(--c-answered); color: #fff;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 70%, 50% 100%, 0% 70%);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    .shape-notans {
      width: 24px; height: 22px; background: var(--c-not-answered); color: #fff;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 30%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%, 0% 30%);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    .shape-notvisit {
      width: 24px; height: 22px; background: var(--box-bg); border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    .shape-review {
      width: 22px; height: 22px; background: var(--c-review); color: #fff;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold;
    }
    .shape-ans-review {
      width: 22px; height: 22px; background: var(--c-review); color: #fff;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; position: relative;
    }
    .shape-ans-review::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0;
      width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid #fff;
    }

    .palette-grid-box {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 12px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .p-node {
      width: 40px; height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; position: relative;
    }
    .p-node.not-visited { background: var(--c-not-visited); border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
    .p-node.not-answered { background: var(--c-not-answered); color: #fff; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 30%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%, 0% 30%); }
    .p-node.answered { background: var(--c-answered); color: #fff; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 70%, 50% 100%, 0% 70%); }
    .p-node.review { background: var(--c-review); color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; }
    .p-node.ans-review { background: var(--c-review); color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; }
    .p-node.ans-review::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; bottom: 1px; right: 1px; width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid #fff;
    }
    .p-node.current { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #0284c7; }

    .p-node.review-state-correct { background: #22c55e !important; color: #fff !important; clip-path: none !important; border-radius: 4px; }
    .p-node.review-state-wrong { background: #ef4444 !important; color: #fff !important; clip-path: none !important; border-radius: 4px; }
    .p-node.review-state-skipped { background: #94a3b8 !important; color: #0f172a !important; clip-path: none !important; border-radius: 4px; }

    /* STAGE 7: Result Sheet */
    .result-sheet {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 22px auto;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--accent-pink);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-pink);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 26px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .congrats-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #be185d;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    body.dark-mode .congrats-title { color: #f472b6; }
    .res-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }
    .res-card {
      background: rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.1);
      border: 2px solid #fbcfe8;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .res-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--text-main); }

    /* Analytics Graphs */
    .analytics-visual-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 30px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .pie-chart-wrap {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: conic-gradient(#22c55e 0deg 0deg, #ef4444 0deg 0deg, #94a3b8 0deg 360deg);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      position: relative;
    }
    .pie-inner-circle {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--box-bg);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .bar-graph-wrap {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 250px;
      max-width: 400px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .bar-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; }
    .bar-track { height: 12px; background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; }
    .bar-fill-correct { height: 100%; background: #22c55e; width: 0%; transition: width 0.8s ease; }
    .bar-fill-wrong { height: 100%; background: #ef4444; width: 0%; transition: width 0.8s ease; }
    .bar-fill-skipped { height: 100%; background: #94a3b8; width: 0%; transition: width 0.8s ease; }

    /* MOBILE RESPONSIVE ZERO-OVERLAP */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-card { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 22px 16px; margin-top: 10px; gap: 18px; }
      .profile-img-circle { width: 120px; height: 120px; }
      .candidate-name-badge { font-size: 19px; }
      .quote-english { font-size: 16px; }
      .quote-hindi { font-size: 19px; }

      .corner-mascot-left { width: 60px; bottom: 8px; left: 8px; }
      .corner-mascot-right { width: 55px; bottom: 8px; right: 8px; }
      .anime-mascot-mid-left { width: 52px; top: 12px; left: 8px; }
      .anime-mascot-mid-right { width: 55px; top: 12px; right: 8px; }

      .btn-mobile-palette-toggle { display: inline-block; }
      .top-exam-nav { flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 6px 12px; gap: 6px; }
      .palette-dock {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        right: -100%;
        height: 100vh;
        width: 84%;
        z-index: 200;
        background: var(--box-bg);
        box-shadow: -4px 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        transition: right 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      }
      .palette-dock.drawer-open { right: 0; }
      .palette-backdrop {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
        z-index: 190;
        display: none;
      }
      .palette-backdrop.drawer-open { display: block; }
      .palette-grid-box { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }

      .q-footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; }
      .q-footer > div { width: 100%; display: flex; gap: 6px; }
      .btn-act, .btn-save, .btn-submit { flex: 1; padding: 8px 4px; font-size: 12px; }

      .analytics-visual-box { flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
      .bar-graph-wrap { width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- STAGE 1: Profile & Dashboard -->
  <div class="view-screen active-view" id="viewStage1">
    <div class="hero-container">
      <img src="https://pngfre.com/wp-content/uploads/anime-33.png" alt="Anime Corner Left" class="corner-mascot-left">
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bd/Doraemon_character.png" alt="Doraemon Right" class="corner-mascot-right">
      <img src="https://www.pngmart.com/files/13/Demon-Anime-Boy-Background-PNG.png" alt="Demon Anime Boy Left" class="anime-mascot-mid-left">
      <img src="https://www.pngmart.com/files/13/Aesthetic-Anime-Boy-PNG-Picture.png" alt="Aesthetic Anime Boy Right" class="anime-mascot-mid-right">

      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="profile-wrap">
          <img id="userPhotoMain" class="profile-img-circle" src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/b0/b8/81/b0b881f13789d87f5339564b0d5aed3e.jpg" alt="SHIV" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://i.pinimg.com/736x/b0/b8/81/b0b881f13789d87f5339564b0d5aed3e.jpg';">
          <div class="candidate-name-badge">COMMANDER SHIV</div>
          <div style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px;">Target: IBPS RRB 2027 🎯</div>
          
          <button class="dashboard-theme-btn" onclick="toggleColorTheme()">
            <span id="themeBtnText">🌙 Dark Mode</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-content">
          <div class="quote-english">
            "Remember to look up at the stars and not down at your feet. Never give up work. Work gives you meaning and purpose and life is empty without it."
          </div>
          <div class="quote-hindi">
            "हमेशा सितारों की ओर ऊपर देखना याद रखें, अपने पैरों के नीचे नहीं। कर्म कभी मत छोड़िए, क्योंकि कर्म ही जीवन को सार्थकता और उद्देश्य देता है।"
          </div>
          <div class="hawking-bar">
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/Stephen_Hawking.StarChild.jpg" alt="Stephen Hawking" class="hawking-img">
            <div>
              <div style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #be185d;">Professor Stephen Hawking</div>
              <div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700;">Theoretical Physicist & Cosmologist</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="action-btn" style="margin-top:24px;" onclick="goToStage(2)">आगे बढ़ें: Speed Math Vault ➡️</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE 2: Tables (21 to 30) + 16:9 Banner + Quick Access Strip -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStage2">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(1)">⬅️ Home</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #be185d; font-size:20px;">Tables (21 से 30)</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(3)">Next: Cubes ➡️</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Exact 16:9 Landscape Banner (Location & Size Maintained) -->
      <div class="yt-thumbnail-wrap">
        <div class="yt-aspect-container">
          <img id="landscapeBannerImg" class="landscape-img" src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/77/08/c1/7708c188a2f67f5f3ad3df0b7748a8af.jpg" alt="Landscape Photo">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Vault Access Buttons Next to Banner -->
      <div class="vault-side-strip">
        <button class="btn-vault-chip" onclick="goToStage('Syllabus')">📚 RRB PO/Clerk Syllabus</button>
        <button class="btn-vault-chip" onclick="goToStage('Fractions')">📊 % to Fraction Vault</button>
        <button class="btn-vault-chip" onclick="goToStage('Reasoning')">🧠 Reasoning Tricks Vault</button>
        <button class="btn-vault-chip" onclick="goToStage('PracticeSets')">📑 Practice PDF / Test Sets</button>
      </div>

      <div class="tables-grid" id="tablesContainer"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE 3: Cubes (11 to 25) -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStage3">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(2)">⬅️ Tables</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #9333ea; font-size:20px;">Cubes (11 से 25)</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(4)">Next: Squares ➡️</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cubes-grid" id="cubesContainer"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE 4: Squares (1 to 100) -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStage4">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(3)">⬅️ Cubes</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #16a34a; font-size:20px;">Squares (1 से 100)</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage('Rules')">Next: Divisibility Rules ➡️</button>
      </div>
      <div class="squares-grid" id="squaresContainer"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE: Divisibility Rules (1 to 20) -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStageRules">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(4)">⬅️ Squares</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #0284c7; font-size:20px;">Divisibility Rules (1-20)</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(5)">Next: Exam Setup 🚀</button>
      </div>
      <div class="rules-grid" id="rulesContainer"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE: Percentage to Fractions Vault -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStageFractions">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(2)">⬅️ Back (Speed Math)</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #d97706; font-size:20px;">Banking % to Fraction Vault</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(5)">Exam Setup 🚀</button>
      </div>
      <div class="frac-grid" id="fractionsContainer"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE: RRB PO & Clerk Syllabus (Pre + Mains) -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStageSyllabus">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(2)">⬅️ Back (Speed Math)</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #be185d; font-size:20px;">IBPS RRB PO & Clerk Complete Exam Roadmap</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(5)">Exam Setup 🚀</button>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card">
        <h3>🎯 1. RRB Prelims Exam Pattern (PO & Office Assistant - Composite 45 Min)</h3>
        <ul class="syll-list">
          <li><b>Reasoning Ability:</b> 40 Questions | 40 Marks (Puzzles, Seating Arrangement, Syllogism, Inequality, Coding-Decoding, Blood Relation, Order & Ranking)</li>
          <li><b>Quantitative Aptitude:</b> 40 Questions | 40 Marks (Simplification/Approximation, Missing/Wrong Series, Quadratic Equations, Data Interpretation - Bar/Table/Line/Pie/Caselet, Arithmetic Word Problems)</li>
          <li><b>Total:</b> 80 Questions | 80 Marks | <b>Negative Marking:</b> 0.25 (1/4th)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card" style="border-color:#0284c7; border-left-color:#0369a1;">
        <h3 style="color:#0284c7;">🏆 2. RRB Mains Exam Pattern (Composite 2 Hours - 200 Marks)</h3>
        <ul class="syll-list">
          <li><b>Reasoning:</b> 40 Qs | 50 Marks (High-level Machine Input-Output, Coded Syllogism/Inequality, Critical Reasoning, Multi-variable Puzzles)</li>
          <li><b>Quantitative Aptitude / Numerical Ability:</b> 40 Qs | 50 Marks (Arithmetic DI, Caselet DI, Data Sufficiency, Quantity 1 vs Quantity 2)</li>
          <li><b>General Awareness:</b> 40 Qs | 40 Marks (Banking Awareness, RBI Circulars, Static GK, Current Affairs past 6 months)</li>
          <li><b>English / Hindi Language:</b> 40 Qs | 40 Marks (Reading Comprehension, Cloze Test, Error Detection, Fillers, Para Jumbles)</li>
          <li><b>Computer Knowledge:</b> 40 Qs | 20 Marks (Networking, MS Office, DBMS, Hardware/Software, Cyber Security)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE: Reasoning Vault -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStageReasoning">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(2)">⬅️ Back (Speed Math)</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #7c3aed; font-size:20px;">Banking Reasoning Speed Vault</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(5)">Exam Setup 🚀</button>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card" style="border-color:#7c3aed; border-left-color:#6d28d9;">
        <h3 style="color:#7c3aed;">🔤 1. Alphabet Opposite Reverse Letter Pairs (A-Z)</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--text-main);">Trick Mnemonics to remember easily:</p>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap:8px; font-family:monospace; font-size:14px;">
          <div class="square-box"><b>A ↔ Z</b> (Azad)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>B ↔ Y</b> (Boy)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>C ↔ X</b> (Crux)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>D ↔ W</b> (Dew)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>E ↔ V</b> (Even)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>F ↔ U</b> (FUll)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>G ↔ T</b> (GT Road)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>H ↔ S</b> (High School)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>I ↔ R</b> (Indian Railway)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>J ↔ Q</b> (Jack Queen)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>K ↔ P</b> (Kamal Pasand)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>L ↔ O</b> (LOve)</div>
          <div class="square-box"><b>M ↔ N</b> (MaN)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card" style="border-color:#16a34a; border-left-color:#15803d;">
        <h3 style="color:#16a34a;">⚡ 2. Coded Inequality Direct Priority Rules</h3>
        <ul class="syll-list">
          <li><b>King Family (Priority 1):</b> $>$ or $<$ (Definite Relation)</li>
          <li><b>Soldier Family (Priority 2):</b> $\ge$ or $\le$ (Dual Relation)</li>
          <li><b>Public (Priority 3):</b> $=$ (Always yields to King/Soldier)</li>
          <li><b>Opposite Signs Blockage:</b> If path contains opposing symbols ($>$ and $<$), No definite relation forms $\rightarrow$ False (Check for Either-Or).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card" style="border-color:#d97706; border-left-color:#b45309;">
        <h3 style="color:#d97706;">🧭 3. Direction Sense Cardinal Reference</h3>
        <ul class="syll-list">
          <li>Facing North: Right = East (+X), Left = West (-X)</li>
          <li>Facing South: Right = West (-X), Left = East (+X)</li>
          <li>Pythagoras Theorem for Shortest Distance: $H = \sqrt{P^2 + B^2}$</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE: Ready Practice Question Sets (PDF/Direct Exam Load) -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStagePracticeSets">
    <div class="math-vault-screen">
      <div class="math-header-bar">
        <div>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage(2)">⬅️ Back (Speed Math)</button>
          <h2 style="display:inline-block; margin-left: 12px; color: #be185d; font-size:20px;">Practice Sets (Maths & Reasoning)</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="action-btn" onclick="goToStage(5)">Custom JSON Setup 🚀</button>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card">
        <h3>⚡ Set 1: Speed Maths 10 Qs (Simplification, Series, Quadratic)</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Exact RRB Clerk / PO 2026-2027 standard mixed practice set.</p>
        <button class="action-btn" style="padding:8px 18px; font-size:13px;" onclick="loadPredefinedTest(1)">🚀 Load & Start Live in Exam Portal</button>
      </div>

      <div class="syll-card" style="border-color:#7c3aed; border-left-color:#6d28d9;">
        <h3 style="color:#7c3aed;">🧠 Set 2: Reasoning 10 Qs (Inequality, Syllogism, Alpha-Numeric)</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">High-scoring pre speed booster set with timer tracking.</p>
        <button class="action-btn" style="background:#7c3aed; padding:8px 18px; font-size:13px;" onclick="loadPredefinedTest(2)">🚀 Load & Start Live in Exam Portal</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE 5: JSON & Custom Timer Setup -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStage5">
    <div style="flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding: 16px;">
      <div class="setup-wrap">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <h2 style="color: #be185d; font-size: 20px;">IBPS RRB Exam Setup</h2>
          <button class="btn-back" onclick="goToStage('Rules')">⬅️ Back</button>
        </div>

        <div class="timer-selector-bar">
          <span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 800;">⏱️ परीक्षा का समय चुनें:</span>
          <button class="time-chip" onclick="setTimeManual(5, this)">5 Min</button>
          <button class="time-chip" onclick="setTimeManual(10, this)">10 Min</button>
          <button class="time-chip" onclick="setTimeManual(15, this)">15 Min</button>
          <button class="time-chip active" onclick="setTimeManual(20, this)">20 Min</button>
          <button class="time-chip" onclick="setTimeManual(45, this)">45 Min</button>
          <span style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); font-weight:700;">कस्टम:</span>
          <input type="number" id="customMinutesInput" class="time-custom-input" placeholder="Min" onchange="setTimeCustom(this.value)">
        </div>

        <div class="prompt-banner-bar">
          <span style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700;">नीचे JSON कोड पेस्ट करें:</span>
          <button class="btn-prompt-open" onclick="openPromptModal()">🤖 Get AI JSON Master Prompt</button>
        </div>

        <textarea id="jsonPayload">[
  {
    "q": "Directions: Study the following information carefully.\nEight persons sitting around a circular table facing center.\nQ1. What is 18 × 6 = ?",
    "options": ["108", "98", "118", "104", "None of these"],
    "ans": 0,
    "exp": "18 × 6 = 108"
  },
  {
    "q": "Q2. What is the square of 24?",
    "options": ["526", "576", "676", "586", "None of these"],
    "ans": 1,
    "exp": "24² = 576"
  }
]</textarea>
        <button class="action-btn" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 14px;" onclick="startLiveExam()">🚀 Start Real IBPS Exam Live</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI JSON PROMPT MODAL -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="promptModal" onclick="closePromptModal(event)">
    <div class="modal-card" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <b style="color: #7c3aed; font-size: 15px;">🤖 Master System Prompt for AI (PDF to JSON)</b>
        <button class="btn-back" style="padding: 2px 8px;" onclick="closePromptModal()">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body" id="masterPromptText">You are an elite IBPS Banking Exam Assistant. Convert the provided questions (from document, text, or PDF) into a STRICT JSON ARRAY of objects.

Output MUST be ONLY valid, parsable raw JSON code starting with `[` and ending with `]`. No markdown ticks (```json), no conversational opening, and no conclusion.

Each object MUST match this exact schema:
{
  "q": "Question title, directions and full numerical / puzzle problem text here with \\n for line breaks.",
  "options": ["Option A", "Option B", "Option C", "Option D", "Option E"],
  "ans": 0, // Zero-based integer index of correct option (0 for A, 1 for B, 2 for C, 3 for D, 4 for E)
  "exp": "Clear step-by-step Hindi/English short explanation"
}

STRICT CONSTRAINTS:
1. Exactly 5 options per question (IBPS Banking Format). If none exists, include 'None of these'.
2. Do not omit directions or puzzle base paragraphs in 'q'.
3. Maintain zero-based indexing for 'ans' (0 to 4).</div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button class="btn-back" onclick="closePromptModal()">Cancel</button>
        <button class="action-btn" style="background:#7c3aed; padding: 9px 16px;" onclick="copyPromptToClipboard()">📋 Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAGE 6: Real TCS Banking Exam Portal -->
  <div class="view-screen" id="viewStage6">
    <div class="top-exam-nav">
      <div id="examTopTitle">IBPS RRB Sectional Test 2027</div>
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 10px;">
        <button class="btn-mobile-palette-toggle" onclick="toggleMobilePalette()">📑 Palette</button>
        <div class="auto-toggle" id="autoToggleContainer">
          <span>Auto:</span>
          <label class="switch">
            <input type="checkbox" id="autoNextSwitch" checked>
            <span class="slider"></span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff; color: #000; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12.5px;">
          Time: <span id="masterTimer" style="color: #d32f2f;">00 : 20 : 00</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exam-split">
      <div class="palette-backdrop" id="paletteBackdrop" onclick="toggleMobilePalette()"></div>

      <div class="q-main">
        <div class="q-strip">
          <span id="labelQNum">Question 1 / 40</span>
          <div style="display:flex; gap: 12px;">
            <span id="qTimerWrap">Time: <b id="qStopwatch">00 : 00</b></span>
            <span>Marks: <b style="color: #16a34a;">+1</b> | <b style="color: #dc2626;">-0.25</b></span>
